{"q":"59","t":"Spiral Matrix II","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a positive integer <code>n</code>, generate an <code>n x n</code> <code>matrix</code> filled with elements from <code>1</code> to <code>n<sup>2</sup></code> in spiral order.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/d7adcdd890ae869c.jpg\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 242px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 3\n<strong>Output:</strong> [[1,2,3],[8,9,4],[7,6,5]]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 1\n<strong>Output:</strong> [[1]]\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 20</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"generateMatrix\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"n\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer[][]\",\r\n    \"rowsize\": \"param_1\",\r\n    \"colsize\": \"param_1\",\r\n    \"dealloc\": true\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Matrix","slug":"matrix"},{"name":"Simulation","slug":"simulation"}],"s":[{"t":"Spiral Matrix","s":"spiral-matrix","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Spiral Matrix III","s":"spiral-matrix-iii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Spiral Matrix IV","s":"spiral-matrix-iv","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["eBay","ebay"],["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"]]}